[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=UU 远程（控制其他电脑）
Name[en]=UU Remote (control other computers)
Keywords=UU;UUWay;远程;Remote;
Comment=打开 UU 窗口连接其他电脑；使用期间本机暂停被控，从 UU 托盘退出后自动恢复
Comment[en]=Open the UU window to connect to other computers; hosting pauses until UU is quit from its tray icon
Exec=/usr/bin/uuway open
Icon=uuway
Terminal=false
Categories=Network;RemoteAccess;
OnlyShowIn=KDE;
